---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BatteryPassportViewer from '../../components/BatteryPassportViewer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Stationary Storage & Industrial Battery Passports | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Digital Product Passport compliance for industrial batteries and stationary battery energy storage systems (BESS >2kWh) under EU 2023/1542."
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-radial-gradient">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-accent-teal uppercase tracking-widest bg-accent-teal/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-accent-teal/20">
          Stationary ESS & Industrial Systems
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mt-4 mb-6">
          Storage Battery Passports (>2kWh): Utility & C&I BESS
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          The European boom in renewable grid storage demands strict traceability. EU DPP Provider equips containerized BESS, commercial & industrial (C&I) racks, and telecom backup systems with compliant digital passports and lifecycle data tracking.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Matrix -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 my-16">
        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🏭</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Containerized BESS & Rack Hierarchy</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Multi-level digital passport hierarchy linking Container &rarr; Rack &rarr; High-voltage Module &rarr; Cell levels for granular maintenance and second-life tracking.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Grid Storage Round-Trip Efficiency</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Standardized logging of certified initial capacity, internal resistance, and energy round-trip efficiency required for European grid operator interconnection audits.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🔄</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Second-Life & Repurposing Protocols</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Provide certified health certificates and residual capacity history when transitioning decommissioned EV packs into stationary storage systems.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Live Simulator -->
      <div class="my-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Interactive Industrial Battery Passport Simulation</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Simulate an actual industrial storage passport below</p>
        </div>
        <BatteryPassportViewer />
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-900/60 via-slate-900 to-brand-950 border border-brand-500/30 text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Ensure Your Energy Storage Export Compliance</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Contact our stationary storage team for customized rack and container serialization workflows.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-brand-500 text-white font-bold text-sm hover:opacity-90">
          Book Storage Solution Consultation &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
